      "id": "claim_a3c1fca8143241f2ab151c4b45559643",
      "statement": "The client-side SSH ceiling defaults to ten and normalizes to 1–100, with independent per-connection FIFO budgets, non-revoking decreases and cancellation-safe queued admission. tryAcquire refuses closed or saturated budgets and budgets with queued waiters; permitsConcurrentControl describes configured concurrency rather than current free capacity.",
